      "text": "PK = Primary Key\nFK = Foreign Key\n\n─── solid = FK constraint\n··· dotted = logical ref\n--- dashed = vector store\n\n1 ── N = one-to-many\n\n🟡 Central entity\n🔵🟢🟣 FK-linked tables\n🔴🟠 Logical refs (no FK)",
